(7358895, 1152095, 69325, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, whenever I see a homeless person, I always think to myself "at one time, that was someones baby that they loved".....or maybe they weren''t and that was part of the problem.</td>', 'It''s funny, whenever I see a homeless person, I always think to myself "at one time, that was someones baby that they loved".....or maybe they weren''t and that was part of the problem.', '2015-06-08 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358898, 1152296, 69325, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been better with maybe a tighter crop and a little improvement on the b&amp;w conversion, nice subject however</td>', 'I think this could have been better with maybe a tighter crop and a little improvement on the b&w conversion, nice subject however', '2015-06-08 13:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358902, 1152214, 69325, '<td valign="top">it lacks a little punch as far as contrast goes but i love the composition</td>', 'it lacks a little punch as far as contrast goes but i love the composition', '2015-06-08 13:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358906, 1151640, 69325, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''ve seen a lot of studio style portraits that mary did but, while technically well done, this just seems like far too much of a "set up" shot for a challenge in her style.</td>', 'Sorry, I''ve seen a lot of studio style portraits that mary did but, while technically well done, this just seems like far too much of a "set up" shot for a challenge in her style.', '2015-06-08 13:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358912, 1152216, 159723, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Interesting (but perhaps not unexpected) to see how many entries involve smoke breaks. This is my favourite :) Nice b&amp;w. Looks almost untouched in terms of processing. Nice! Voted earlier.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Interesting (but perhaps not unexpected) to see how many entries involve smoke breaks. This is my favourite :) Nice b&w. Looks almost untouched in terms of processing. Nice! Voted earlier.', '2015-06-08 14:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358920, 1152271, 159723, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely among my favourites in this challenge. If the goal was to "copy" Mark''s style, then I think it should be a little bit brighter, but as a "Mark''s inspired" image it''s great! (Hope that made sense!) Voted earlier.</td>', 'This is absolutely among my favourites in this challenge. If the goal was to "copy" Mark''s style, then I think it should be a little bit brighter, but as a "Mark''s inspired" image it''s great! (Hope that made sense!) Voted earlier.', '2015-06-08 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358922, 1152260, 159723, '<td valign="top">Back to comment! This is such a great image and so perfect for the challenge! Bumping it up to a 10!  My absolute favourite in this challenge!</td>', 'Back to comment! This is such a great image and so perfect for the challenge! Bumping it up to a 10!  My absolute favourite in this challenge!', '2015-06-08 14:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358923, 1152181, 159723, '<td valign="top">Good shot! Would have preferred a bit more connection with at least one of the boys. And I don''t mind the blur in the corner. Made me think of Mark''s portraits of Dennis Hopper with the black blur :) Voted earlier.</td>', 'Good shot! Would have preferred a bit more connection with at least one of the boys. And I don''t mind the blur in the corner. Made me think of Mark''s portraits of Dennis Hopper with the black blur :) Voted earlier.', '2015-06-08 14:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358925, 1152000, 159723, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. Gorgeous girl, gorgeous shot! Stunning!</td>', 'Back to comment. Gorgeous girl, gorgeous shot! Stunning!', '2015-06-08 14:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358927, 1152214, 159723, '<td valign="top">Bumping this up to a 10! For me this is the entry that best captures the connecting between subject and photographer that I think is one of the nicest features of Mark''s work. Well done!</td>', 'Bumping this up to a 10! For me this is the entry that best captures the connecting between subject and photographer that I think is one of the nicest features of Mark''s work. Well done!', '2015-06-08 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
