(7358931, 1152095, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great shot and great title! Very Marks'' like! Bumping up to a 9!</td>', 'Great shot and great title! Very Marks'' like! Bumping up to a 9!', '2015-06-08 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358946, 1152262, 159723, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. I really like this shot, but I''m not so keen on the monochromatic (Is that what it is called?). I don''t think that it has to be b&amp;w just because it''s a In the style of MEM challenge, but the blue is not doing it for me here. Still, one of the best images for me :)</td>', 'Back to comment. I really like this shot, but I''m not so keen on the monochromatic (Is that what it is called?). I don''t think that it has to be b&w just because it''s a In the style of MEM challenge, but the blue is not doing it for me here. Still, one of the best images for me :)', '2015-06-08 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358947, 1152289, 159723, '<td valign="top">I would love to see eye contact in this particular image, but that is just me :) Great shot, nice b&amp;w and interesting subject! Voted earlier!</td>', 'I would love to see eye contact in this particular image, but that is just me :) Great shot, nice b&w and interesting subject! Voted earlier!', '2015-06-08 14:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358949, 1152104, 159723, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier. I would probably score this higher if the processing was a bit different. I still consider myself a newbie, so I can''t tell really say what I would like differently. Perhaps making it a bit darker or some vignetting? I don''t know. Still, for me this is one of the best images in terms of emulating what Mark''s could take a photo of--people doing everyday stuff. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier. I would probably score this higher if the processing was a bit different. I still consider myself a newbie, so I can''t tell really say what I would like differently. Perhaps making it a bit darker or some vignetting? I don''t know. Still, for me this is one of the best images in terms of emulating what Mark''s could take a photo of--people doing everyday stuff. Well done!', '2015-06-08 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358951, 1152160, 159723, '<td valign="top">back to comment. I think this is a great portrait! After initial viewing and voting this was one of three or four entries that stuck. Perfect for this challenge, I think! :)</td>', 'back to comment. I think this is a great portrait! After initial viewing and voting this was one of three or four entries that stuck. Perfect for this challenge, I think! :)', '2015-06-08 14:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7358954, 1152129, 159723, '<td valign="top">Not quite as powerful as the original, but still a great image as this is not a copy challenge! The girl does a great job in expressing the emotion that I feel in the original. Well done, both of you :) (voted earlier)</td>', 'Not quite as powerful as the original, but still a great image as this is not a copy challenge! The girl does a great job in expressing the emotion that I feel in the original. Well done, both of you :) (voted earlier)', '2015-06-08 14:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7359004, 1152181, 114285, '<td valign="top">A rebel in the making, no diving to him means ''yeh lets dive'' <br/> <br/>There''s something about this image that draws me in, the static motion of the boys, almost like they''re frozen in time, the boy is not really going anywhere, he wants to dive but someone is holding him back, the other boy is contemplating what he should do, he''s wiser.<br/> <br/>Seems a little over sharpened...., small nitpick, should do well IMHO.</td>', 'A rebel in the making, no diving to him means ''yeh lets dive''  There''s something about this image that draws me in, the static motion of the boys, almost like they''re frozen in time, the boy is not really going anywhere, he wants to dive but someone is holding him back, the other boy is contemplating what he should do, he''s wiser. Seems a little over sharpened...., small nitpick, should do well IMHO.', '2015-06-08 16:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
