(7359393, 1151756, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great composition! Looks like you''ve made a  bit of an effort to find a good location for your shoot. That is a big plus in my book! However, somehow I am not quite sold on the story. I can''t really put my finger on what it is, but it looks a little bit staged. And the processing is really good. Maybe a little bit too good for this challenge I think, if that makes sense! Still, great job!</td>', 'Great composition! Looks like you''ve made a  bit of an effort to find a good location for your shoot. That is a big plus in my book! However, somehow I am not quite sold on the story. I can''t really put my finger on what it is, but it looks a little bit staged. And the processing is really good. Maybe a little bit too good for this challenge I think, if that makes sense! Still, great job!', '2015-06-09 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7359396, 1152248, 159723, '<td valign="top">I totally belive this shot! Really does look like pure love :) Well done!</td>', 'I totally belive this shot! Really does look like pure love :) Well done!', '2015-06-09 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7359552, 1152101, 40391, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2015-06-09 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7359756, 1152181, 53147, '<td valign="top">Not exactly sure what it is about this image but it is striking to me. Interesting capture of static and movement, cool perspective, the lack of faces - all parts of what grabs me but still those are just pieces of a larger whole that I can''t fill in the blanks. I just dig it. Not sure if it is in her style (I didn''t do a lot of research) but I don''t care. My fave of the challenge.</td>', 'Not exactly sure what it is about this image but it is striking to me. Interesting capture of static and movement, cool perspective, the lack of faces - all parts of what grabs me but still those are just pieces of a larger whole that I can''t fill in the blanks. I just dig it. Not sure if it is in her style (I didn''t do a lot of research) but I don''t care. My fave of the challenge.', '2015-06-10 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
