(7361140, 1151842, 159723, '<td valign="top">Compared to some of the other entries in this challenge, this is not quite as interesting. But for me the b&amp;w is great and I think all the different shaded lines and areas adds to the image. Best of luck!</td>', 'Compared to some of the other entries in this challenge, this is not quite as interesting. But for me the b&w is great and I think all the different shaded lines and areas adds to the image. Best of luck!', '2015-06-12 07:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7361141, 1152005, 159723, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it is just me, but I get SO much more out of this image when I tilt my head to the side. Only then do i feel like I get eye contact. I like that the image does not look like its had a lot of post-processing done to it. Good luck!</td>', 'Perhaps it is just me, but I get SO much more out of this image when I tilt my head to the side. Only then do i feel like I get eye contact. I like that the image does not look like its had a lot of post-processing done to it. Good luck!', '2015-06-12 07:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7361142, 1152268, 159723, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing the inspiration from Mark, but it is a very sweet image and the b&amp;w is solid! Best of luck! :)</td>', 'I''m not seeing the inspiration from Mark, but it is a very sweet image and the b&w is solid! Best of luck! :)', '2015-06-12 07:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
