(7361696, 1152000, 135629, '<td valign="top">Perfect emotion here, great model, love the entire composition of this image right down to the noise. I think you will wind up with a nice blue ribbon for this entry, my only 10.</td>', 'Perfect emotion here, great model, love the entire composition of this image right down to the noise. I think you will wind up with a nice blue ribbon for this entry, my only 10.', '2015-06-13 09:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
