(7362156, 1152215, 156466, '<td valign="top">Right mood and look, and extremely well done.  It lacks a sense of woe that I get from MEM''s work, which is the only reason I''m stopping at 8. He''s just a little too well put together and clean.</td>', 'Right mood and look, and extremely well done.  It lacks a sense of woe that I get from MEM''s work, which is the only reason I''m stopping at 8. He''s just a little too well put together and clean.', '2015-06-14 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7362157, 1151756, 156466, '<td valign="top">Thinking that motion in the fan might have added that last point to an excellent capture in the style of MEM.</td>', 'Thinking that motion in the fan might have added that last point to an excellent capture in the style of MEM.', '2015-06-14 09:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7362158, 1152248, 156466, '<td valign="top">Just the right amount of sadness in the love to keep it in the style of...</td>', 'Just the right amount of sadness in the love to keep it in the style of...', '2015-06-14 09:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7362160, 1152110, 156466, '<td valign="top">The headline ticker, half a human and the talking head ad are just too distracting for me.  Remove any one (particularly the man) and I might be OK with an otherwise nice capture, but it''s just too busy.</td>', 'The headline ticker, half a human and the talking head ad are just too distracting for me.  Remove any one (particularly the man) and I might be OK with an otherwise nice capture, but it''s just too busy.', '2015-06-14 09:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7362161, 1152252, 156466, '<td valign="top">It''s odd, but it feels like the slide was laid down purposefully and not just fallen over.  I can''t tell you why, but it does.  If it didn''t I''d be giving this more than the 7 I am.</td>', 'It''s odd, but it feels like the slide was laid down purposefully and not just fallen over.  I can''t tell you why, but it does.  If it didn''t I''d be giving this more than the 7 I am.', '2015-06-14 09:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7362162, 1151640, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m just not feeling even an ounce of MEM here.</td>', 'I''m just not feeling even an ounce of MEM here.', '2015-06-14 09:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
