(7363000, 1152252, 65858, '<td valign="top">Thank you, Mariuca, that means a lot! =)<br/> <br/>Lol, Elena, how did you guess? I had to tell her that I was going to give all her toys to her sister. That riled her up. I felt pretty bad about it, to be honest, and assured her later it was only to make her stop smiling. I didn''t pose here, this is her natural anxious.<br/> <br/>Jake - you got me, I guess I wasn''t thoughtful enough with the slide.</td>', 'Thank you, Mariuca, that means a lot! =) Lol, Elena, how did you guess? I had to tell her that I was going to give all her toys to her sister. That riled her up. I felt pretty bad about it, to be honest, and assured her later it was only to make her stop smiling. I didn''t pose here, this is her natural anxious. Jake - you got me, I guess I wasn''t thoughtful enough with the slide.', '2015-06-15 02:35:37.000000', NULL, 0),
