(7363102, 1152129, 103032, '<td valign="top">I really don''t peruse the member challenges as much since I can''t vote on them.  With that said, yours would have been my top pick.  It''s gritty and really reminds me of a Mary Ellen Mark image from what I''ve seen of her work.  Everything hits the mark for me.  Your oldest really has that attitude look; props to her.<br/> <br/>There were a few that stood out for me, but this one made me think "whoa."</td>', 'I really don''t peruse the member challenges as much since I can''t vote on them.  With that said, yours would have been my top pick.  It''s gritty and really reminds me of a Mary Ellen Mark image from what I''ve seen of her work.  Everything hits the mark for me.  Your oldest really has that attitude look; props to her. There were a few that stood out for me, but this one made me think "whoa."', '2015-06-15 04:59:46.000000', NULL, 0),
