(7365266, 1152101, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s not often I look on the front page and say, that deserved a ribbon. Well, this deserved a ribbon. Its honesty, intimacy and lack of pretense are its great strengths. Please continue to not "do anything special," and, paradoxically, you''ll continue to make something special. This is excellent.</td>', 'It''s not often I look on the front page and say, that deserved a ribbon. Well, this deserved a ribbon. Its honesty, intimacy and lack of pretense are its great strengths. Please continue to not "do anything special," and, paradoxically, you''ll continue to make something special. This is excellent.', '2015-06-17 02:27:20.000000', NULL, 0),
